    "detailed_description": "VR Houses: Glass Apartment is a groundbreaking experience where photorealism takes center stage. Step beyond the borders of traditional VR games and immerse yourself in a hyper-realistic digital environment. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore the design of a modern apartment where every detail is crafted for unparalleled realism. Wander freely through the space and change levels as you witness the stunning transition from a sunlit day to the calming ambiance of a rainy evening. Marvel at the lifelike textures, the play of light and shadow, and the calming atmosphere that surrounds you. Whether you're basking in the warmth of a sunny day or embracing the tranquility of a rainy evening. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nVR Houses: Glass Apartment invites you to walk through the threshold of photorealism, where your digital environment becomes indistinguishable from reality. Step in, explore, and witness a new era in virtual living. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to your digital home.",
